# A king in check cannot escape by moving (preference)

Standing user preference: A king in check cannot escape by moving to a square still controlled by the opponent, nor by capturing a piece that is protected by another opponent piece.

## Conventions
- A king in check cannot escape by moving to a square still controlled by the opponent, nor by capturing a piece that is protected by another opponent piece.

